'''Drapion''' (Japanese: '''ドラピオン''' ''Dorapion'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

