==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Drapion|134}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Stun Poison''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Nerve Poison''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Koga's Beedrill|9}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

